<h1>Hotel Points vs Cash Calculator</h1>
<p class="sub">Decide whether to use hotel points or pay cash in 30 seconds. Factors in resort fee waivers, 5th-night-free benefits, taxes, and forgone rewards across 9 major hotel loyalty programs.</p>

<div class="hotel-examples-wrapper">
  <div class="hotel-examples-label">Quick-Load Real Booking Scenarios (Illustrative Demo Data)</div>
  <div class="hotel-examples-grid">
    <button type="button" class="btn-hotel-example" id="exampleHilton" data-example="hilton">
      <span>🏨 Hilton 5-Night Resort Stay</span>
      <small style="opacity:0.8;">($1,500 vs 240k pts · Waived resort fees)</small>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="btn-hotel-example" id="exampleMarriott" data-example="marriott">
      <span>🏙️ Marriott 5-Night City Stay</span>
      <small style="opacity:0.8;">($1,250 vs 140k pts · Stay 5 Pay 4)</small>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="btn-hotel-example" id="exampleHyatt" data-example="hyatt">
      <span>✨ Hyatt 2-Night Luxury Stay</span>
      <small style="opacity:0.8;">($850 vs 42k pts · No copay or fees)</small>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="currency-selector" style="margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: right; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
  <button type="button" id="btnShare" class="btn-share" style="padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #0284c7; background: #e0f2fe; color: #0284c7; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;">Share this calculation</button>
  <div>
    <label for="currency" style="font-weight: bold; margin-right: 8px;">Currency</label>
    <select id="currency" style="padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 14px;">
      <option value="USD">USD ($)</option>
      <option value="CNY">CNY (¥)</option>
    </select>
  </div>
</div>
<div id="toast" style="display: none; position: fixed; top: 20px; right: 20px; background: #22c55e; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 4px; z-index: 1000; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">Link copied to clipboard!</div>

<div class="hotel-notice-banner" id="modeNotice">
  <strong>Important:</strong> Enter the total cash price and total points shown at checkout. If the hotel has already applied a fifth-night-free or similar benefit to the displayed points total, do not apply it again.
</div>

<!-- Simple Mode (Default, completes in 30 seconds) -->
<div class="panel" id="simpleModePanel">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="field">
      <label for="programPreset">Hotel Program<span class="hint">Rules & Baselines</span></label>
      <select id="programPreset" style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #d7dee8; font-size: 15px;">
        {% for prog in hotelPrograms %}
        <option value="{{ prog.id }}" data-free-rule="{{ prog.freeNightRule }}" data-usd="{{ prog.valuationScenarioUsdCents }}" data-cny="{{ prog.valuationScenarioCny }}">
          {{ prog.nameEn }}
        </option>
        {% endfor %}
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="nights">Number of Nights<span class="hint" id="hintNights">nights</span></label>
      <input type="number" id="nights" value="1" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="programPolicyCard" class="program-policy-card" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="program-policy-header">
      <span id="policyResortBadge" class="policy-badge waived">Resort Fees Waived</span>
      <span id="policyFreeBadge" class="policy-badge varies">Free Night Policy</span>
    </div>
    <div id="policyText" class="program-policy-text">Enter your reservation details and custom rules below.</div>
    <div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px;">
      Source: <a id="policySourceLink" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="program-source-link">Official Program Terms</a>
      <span id="policyFactChecked" style="margin-left: 8px;">(Verified September 2026)</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row" style="margin-top: 16px;">
    <div class="field">
      <label for="totalCashPrice">Total Cash Price (Taxes & Fees Included)<span class="hint" id="hintTotalCash">$</span></label>
      <input type="number" id="totalCashPrice" min="0" step="1" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 1500" value="">
      <div class="unit">Enter the final cash amount shown on the checkout screen</div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="totalPointsRequired">Total Points Required<span class="hint" id="hintTotalPoints">points</span></label>
      <input type="number" id="totalPointsRequired" min="0" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="e.g. 80000" value="">
      <div class="unit">Enter the final points deducted at checkout (already discounted)</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <div class="field">
      <label for="awardCashFees">Award Out-of-Pocket Cash Fees<span class="hint" id="hintAwardCashFees">$</span></label>
      <input type="number" id="awardCashFees" value="0" min="0" step="1" inputmode="decimal">
      <div class="unit">Usually $0 on full points stays; enter mandatory resort fees or taxes if charged</div>
      <div id="awardFeeNotice" style="display: none; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 6px; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 4px; background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fef3c7; color: #92400e; line-height: 1.4;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="personalValuation">Personal Point Valuation<span class="hint" id="hintValuation">¢/pt (Optional baseline)</span></label>
      <input type="number" id="personalValuation" value="" placeholder="Optional, e.g. 1.0" min="0" step="0.0001" inputmode="decimal">
      <div class="unit" id="unitValuationNote">Optional decision baseline. If empty, the calculator still computes realized CPP and net savings without forcing a subjective recommendation.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Advanced Breakdown Mode (Collapsed) -->
<details class="details-advanced" id="advancedDetails">
  <summary>
    <span>⚙️ Advanced Breakdown: Nightly rates, taxes, resort fees & forgone rewards (Click to expand)</span>
  </summary>
  <div class="advanced-body">
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;">
      Enter per-night line items here to factor in consecutive free night benefits and forgone cash earning. Values automatically sync to the simple total fields above.
    </p>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="nightlyCashPrice">Nightly Room Rate (Pre-tax)<span class="hint" id="hintNightlyCash">$/night</span></label>
        <input type="number" id="nightlyCashPrice" min="0" step="1" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 300">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="pointsPerNight">Points Required / Night<span class="hint">pts/night</span></label>
        <input type="number" id="pointsPerNight" min="0" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="e.g. 20000">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="cashTaxes">Total Cash Room Taxes<span class="hint" id="hintCashTaxes">$</span></label>
        <input type="number" id="cashTaxes" value="0" min="0" step="1" inputmode="decimal">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="cashResortFees">Total Cash Resort/Dest. Fees<span class="hint" id="hintCashResort">$</span></label>
        <input type="number" id="cashResortFees" value="0" min="0" step="1" inputmode="decimal">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="freeNightRule">Consecutive Free Night Policy<span class="hint">Benefit</span></label>
        <select id="freeNightRule" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #d7dee8;">
          <option value="none">No free night discount (Standard stay)</option>
          <option value="5th">5th Night Free (Stay 5, Pay 4 · Marriott, Hilton, etc.)</option>
          <option value="4th">4th Night Free (Stay 4, Pay 3 · Select IHG credit cards)</option>
          <option value="custom">Custom Nth night free</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="field" id="customIntervalField" style="display: none;">
        <label for="customFreeNightInterval">Interval N (e.g. 4 for 4th free)<span class="hint">N value</span></label>
        <input type="number" id="customFreeNightInterval" value="4" min="2" step="1" inputmode="numeric">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="awardTaxes">Award Cash Taxes<span class="hint" id="hintAwardTaxes">$</span></label>
        <input type="number" id="awardTaxes" value="0" min="0" step="1" inputmode="decimal">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="awardResortFees">Award Resort Fees<span class="hint" id="hintAwardResort">$</span></label>
        <input type="number" id="awardResortFees" value="0" min="0" step="1" inputmode="decimal">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="hotelPointsEarnedValue">Forgone Hotel Points Value<span class="hint" id="hintHotelEarned">$ (Optional)</span></label>
        <input type="number" id="hotelPointsEarnedValue" value="0" min="0" step="1" inputmode="decimal">
        <div class="unit">Value of hotel loyalty points you would earn by paying cash</div>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="creditCardRewardsValue">Forgone Credit Card Rewards<span class="hint" id="hintCCEarned">$ (Optional)</span></label>
        <input type="number" id="creditCardRewardsValue" value="0" min="0" step="1" inputmode="decimal">
        <div class="unit">Value of cashback or credit card points earned on cash stay</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>

<!-- Two-Tier Results Section -->
<div class="ticket" aria-live="polite">
  <div class="main">
    <div class="compare">
      <div class="item">
        <div class="k">Redemption Value (CPP)</div>
        <div class="v" id="cppResult" style="word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere;">-</div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <div class="k">Cost Comparison</div>
        <div class="v" id="costCompare" style="font-size:16px; margin-top:8px; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; line-height: 1.5;">
          Points Equiv: -<br>Net Cash Cost: -
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="note" id="explain" style="margin-top: 14px;">Enter total cash price and points required to evaluate your booking.</div>

    <!-- Tier 2: Step-by-Step Mathematical Breakdown -->
    <div class="hotel-tier2-breakdown" id="tier2Breakdown" style="display: none;">
      <div style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 8px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase;">
        Calculation Breakdown & Steps
      </div>
      <div class="hotel-breakdown-step" id="stepGrossCash"></div>
      <div class="hotel-breakdown-step" id="stepForgone" style="display: none;"></div>
      <div class="hotel-breakdown-step" id="stepAwardCash"></div>
      <div class="hotel-breakdown-step" id="stepNetSaved"></div>
      <div class="hotel-breakdown-step" id="stepPoints"></div>
      <div class="hotel-breakdown-step" id="stepValuationComp" style="border-top: 1px dashed rgba(244,240,230,0.2); padding-top: 8px; margin-top: 8px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="perf"></div>
  <div class="stub">
    <div>
      <div class="verdict-label">Verdict</div>
      <div class="verdict" id="verdictText">—</div>
    </div>
    <div class="code" id="verdictCode">DIFF —</div>
  </div>
</div>

<article class="seo-content" style="margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);">
  <h2>9 Major Hotel Loyalty Programs: Rules & Valuation Benchmarks</h2>
  <p>Hotel loyalty programs differ fundamentally in whether they waive resort fees on award nights and how they structure consecutive free night promotions. Here is the verified policy matrix across major chains:</p>

  <div class="hotel-table-container">
    <table class="hotel-comparison-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Hotel Program</th>
          <th>Illustrative Baseline</th>
          <th>Free Night Policy</th>
          <th>Resort Fees on Points</th>
          <th>Official Terms Source</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for prog in hotelPrograms %}
        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ prog.nameEn }}</strong></td>
          <td>{{ prog.valuationScenarioUsdCents }}¢ (approx. ¥{{ prog.valuationScenarioCny }})</td>
          <td>{{ prog.eligibilityNoteEn }}</td>
          <td>
            {% if "Waived" in prog.resortFeeNoteEn %}
            <span class="policy-badge waived">Fully Waived</span>
            {% elseif "Not waived" in prog.resortFeeNoteEn %}
            <span class="policy-badge charged">Mandatory Cash</span>
            {% else %}
            <span class="policy-badge varies">Property Dependent</span>
            {% endif %}
            <div style="font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px;">{{ prog.resortFeeNoteEn }}</div>
          </td>
          <td>
            {% if prog.officialSourceUrl %}
            <a href="{{ prog.officialSourceUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="program-source-link">{{ prog.officialSourceName }}</a>
            {% else %}
            <span style="color: var(--muted);">Custom Input</span>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  
  <h2>Related Guides & Comparisons</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/en/examples/hotel-fifth-night-free-calculation/">Hotel 5th Night Free Calculation Example & Savings Analysis</a></li>
    <li><a href="/en/guides/valuing-hotel-points/">Ultimate Hotel Point Valuation Guide: Dynamic Pricing & 5th Night Free</a></li>
    <li><a href="/en/guides/free-night-awards/">How to Maximize Annual Hotel Free Night Awards (FNC)</a></li>
